      en: ["The square is situated in the center of Victoria on Mahé Island.", "It is a primary venue for Independence Day celebrations held on June 29.", "The landmark Clock Tower, erected in 1903, is located nearby.", "Freedom Square acts as the terminating point for many national parades.", "Surrounding buildings house critical governmental and judicial institutions.", "It functions as a major pedestrian hub within the capital's layout."],
